w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qx4HXki6w0YQ7kNvwFeQaC_&_nc_oc=Adk0fK40Q6nNnwsR_8ZMt5TKiCcBqpCMrJCodoTbVo1qtgNc4SnToTd78kWLZEYC_fk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwwqeh4FrsLYYmhU_VuCexMPT2f3_8-sPTPwBbtiwvTxA&oe=69AC12AA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p92RV78gGbUQ7kNvwHtqRmY&_nc_oc=AdlrcKfYtMt9KZPEh3II-iPVbyIJsPZNuKYl10x6nE9wZxfuIKvQDu10-XEJFJmmgaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxqI1efIWJzSS-lSJoYvVdvWLpqTFUQmcnk7pl3X8p_bA&oe=69AC255E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UvPmt1M6S8IQ7kNvwFxg3aM&_nc_oc=AdnczsgmHE9PdBl-MKxji-d8ZeX0gSGMC-B90SPJhrrJOmVv_8aOcGRZ9cdft2rohbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx1IIdPfJYc79xIJ4D7AALpN5ic2w33WL10Pu6b9trCwg&oe=69AC1431"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9